{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pacer packages are ESM-only, target ES2022, and require Node.js 20 or newer when running in Node.js. The Octane adapter requires Node.js 22.22.2 or newer. Ember includes a CommonJS addon metadata shim for its build tooling; its runtime entry points are ESM. Use ESM imports or dynamic "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"import()"},{"type":"text","value":" when consuming them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the adapter for your framework with your preferred package manager:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-managers"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@tanstack/react-pacer\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@tanstack/solid-pacer\"]],\"angular\":[[\"@tanstack/angular-pacer\"]],\"preact\":[[\"@tanstack/preact-pacer\"]],\"vue\":[[\"@tanstack/vue-pacer\"]],\"svelte\":[[\"@tanstack/svelte-pacer\"]],\"lit\":[[\"@tanstack/lit-pacer\"]],\"alpine\":[[\"@tanstack/alpine-pacer\"]],\"ember\":[[\"@tanstack/ember-pacer\"]],\"octane\":[[\"@tanstack/octane-pacer\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Each framework package re-exports everything from the core "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/pacer"},{"type":"text","value":" package, so you do not need to install the core package separately."}]},{"type":"callout","kind":"note","title":"Note","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Not using a framework? Install the core "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/pacer"},{"type":"text","value":" package directly for vanilla JavaScript."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"react"},"children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Devtools"}],"framework":"react"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Developer tools are available using "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":". Install the devtools adapter and the Pacer devtools plugin as dev dependencies to inspect your pacers at runtime."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"solid"},"children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"devtools-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Devtools"}],"framework":"solid"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Developer tools are available using "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":". Install the devtools adapter and the Pacer devtools plugin as dev dependencies to inspect your pacers at runtime."}]}]}],"properties":{"data-available-frameworks":"[\"react\",\"solid\"]","data-framework-meta":"{\"codeBlocksByFramework\":{\"react\":[],\"solid\":[]}}"}},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@tanstack/react-devtools\"],[\"@tanstack/react-pacer-devtools\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@tanstack/solid-devtools\"],[\"@tanstack/solid-pacer-devtools\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"component","name":"framework","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"react"},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" page for setup and usage."}]}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"solid"},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" page for setup and usage."}]}]}],"properties":{"data-available-frameworks":"[\"react\",\"solid\"]","data-framework-meta":"{\"codeBlocksByFramework\":{\"react\":[],\"solid\":[]}}"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Framework guides cover lifecycle ownership, reactive options, selected state, and helper return values:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./framework/vue/adapter.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./framework/svelte/adapter.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./framework/lit/adapter.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lit"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./framework/alpine/adapter.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Alpine"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./framework/ember/adapter.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ember"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./framework/octane/adapter.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane"}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"devtools","text":"Devtools","level":2,"framework":"react"},{"id":"devtools-2","text":"Devtools","level":2,"framework":"solid"}]},"frameworks":["react","solid","angular","preact","vue","svelte","lit","alpine","ember","octane"],"downloadMarkdown":"\nPacer packages are ESM-only, target ES2022, and require Node.js 20 or newer when running in Node.js. The Octane adapter requires Node.js 22.22.2 or newer. Ember includes a CommonJS addon metadata shim for its build tooling; its runtime entry points are ESM. Use ESM imports or dynamic `import()` when consuming them.\n\nInstall the adapter for your framework with your preferred package manager:\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-managers\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-pacer\nsolid: @tanstack/solid-pacer\nangular: @tanstack/angular-pacer\npreact: @tanstack/preact-pacer\nvue: @tanstack/vue-pacer\nsvelte: @tanstack/svelte-pacer\nlit: @tanstack/lit-pacer\nalpine: @tanstack/alpine-pacer\nember: @tanstack/ember-pacer\noctane: @tanstack/octane-pacer\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\nEach framework package re-exports everything from the core `@tanstack/pacer` package, so you do not need to install the core package separately.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Not using a framework? Install the core `@tanstack/pacer` package directly for vanilla JavaScript.\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n## Devtools\n\nDeveloper tools are available using [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest). Install the devtools adapter and the Pacer devtools plugin as dev dependencies to inspect your pacers at runtime.\n\n# Solid\n\n## Devtools\n\nDeveloper tools are available using [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest). Install the devtools adapter and the Pacer devtools plugin as dev dependencies to inspect your pacers at runtime.\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-devtools\nreact: @tanstack/react-pacer-devtools\nsolid: @tanstack/solid-devtools\nsolid: @tanstack/solid-pacer-devtools\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\nSee the [devtools](./devtools) page for setup and usage.\n\n# Solid\n\nSee the [devtools](./devtools) page for setup and usage.\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\nFramework guides cover lifecycle ownership, reactive options, selected state, and helper return values:\n\n- [Vue](./framework/vue/adapter.md)\n- [Svelte](./framework/svelte/adapter.md)\n- [Lit](./framework/lit/adapter.md)\n- [Alpine](./framework/alpine/adapter.md)\n- [Ember](./framework/ember/adapter.md)\n- [Octane](./framework/octane/adapter.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Installation\nid: installation\n---\n\nPacer packages are ESM-only, target ES2022, and require Node.js 20 or newer when running in Node.js. The Octane adapter requires Node.js 22.22.2 or newer. Ember includes a CommonJS addon metadata shim for its build tooling; its runtime entry points are ESM. Use ESM imports or dynamic `import()` when consuming them.\n\nInstall the adapter for your framework with your preferred package manager:\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-managers\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-pacer\nsolid: @tanstack/solid-pacer\nangular: @tanstack/angular-pacer\npreact: @tanstack/preact-pacer\nvue: @tanstack/vue-pacer\nsvelte: @tanstack/svelte-pacer\nlit: @tanstack/lit-pacer\nalpine: @tanstack/alpine-pacer\nember: @tanstack/ember-pacer\noctane: @tanstack/octane-pacer\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\nEach framework package re-exports everything from the core `@tanstack/pacer` package, so you do not need to install the core package separately.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Not using a framework? Install the core `@tanstack/pacer` package directly for vanilla JavaScript.\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\n## Devtools\n\nDeveloper tools are available using [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest). Install the devtools adapter and the Pacer devtools plugin as dev dependencies to inspect your pacers at runtime.\n\n# Solid\n\n## Devtools\n\nDeveloper tools are available using [TanStack Devtools](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest). Install the devtools adapter and the Pacer devtools plugin as dev dependencies to inspect your pacers at runtime.\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/react-devtools\nreact: @tanstack/react-pacer-devtools\nsolid: @tanstack/solid-devtools\nsolid: @tanstack/solid-pacer-devtools\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n<!-- ::start:framework -->\n\n# React\n\nSee the [devtools](./devtools) page for setup and usage.\n\n# Solid\n\nSee the [devtools](./devtools) page for setup and usage.\n\n<!-- ::end:framework -->\n\nFramework guides cover lifecycle ownership, reactive options, selected state, and helper return values:\n\n- [Vue](./framework/vue/adapter.md)\n- [Svelte](./framework/svelte/adapter.md)\n- [Lit](./framework/lit/adapter.md)\n- [Alpine](./framework/alpine/adapter.md)\n- [Ember](./framework/ember/adapter.md)\n- [Octane](./framework/octane/adapter.md)\n"}
